{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 21, "ref": "ezekiel 20:21", "book": "ezekiel", "lang": "id", "chapter": 20, "translation": "Tetapi anak-anak memberontak terhadap-Ku; dalam ketetapan-Ku mereka tidak berjalan dan ⟨את⟩ peraturan-Ku mereka tidak pegang untuk melakukannya — ⟨את⟩ yang apabila ⟨את⟩ seorang manusia melakukannya, ia akan hidup olehnya — ⟨את⟩ hari-hari sabat-Ku mereka najiskan. Maka Aku berkata untuk mencurahkan amarah-Ku atas mereka, untuk menghabiskan murka-Ku terhadap mereka di padang gurun.", "tokens": [{"surface": "וימרו", "gloss": "Tetapi memberontak"}, {"surface": "בי", "gloss": "terhadap-Ku"}, {"surface": "הבנים", "gloss": "anak-anak"}, {"surface": "בחקותי", "gloss": "dalam ketetapan-Ku"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "tidak"}, {"surface": "הלכו", "gloss": "berjalan"}, {"surface": "ואת", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "peraturan-Ku"}, {"surface": "משפטי", "gloss": "peraturan-Ku"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "tidak"}, {"surface": "שמרו", "gloss": "pegang"}, {"surface": "לעשות", "gloss": "untuk melakukannya"}, {"surface": "אותם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "yang"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "yang"}, {"surface": "יעשה", "gloss": "melakukannya"}, {"surface": "אותם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "seorang manusia"}, {"surface": "האדם", "gloss": "seorang manusia"}, {"surface": "וחי", "gloss": "dan hidup"}, {"surface": "בהם", "gloss": "olehnya"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "hari-hari sabat-Ku"}, {"surface": "שבתותי", "gloss": "hari-hari sabat-Ku"}, {"surface": "חללו", "gloss": "najiskan"}, {"surface": "ואמר", "gloss": "Maka Aku berkata"}, {"surface": "לשפך", "gloss": "untuk mencurahkan"}, {"surface": "חמתי", "gloss": "amarah-Ku"}, {"surface": "עליהם", "gloss": "atas mereka"}, {"surface": "לכלות", "gloss": "untuk menghabiskan"}, {"surface": "אפי", "gloss": "murka-Ku"}, {"surface": "בם", "gloss": "terhadap mereka"}, {"surface": "במדבר", "gloss": "di padang gurun"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-08T18:36:41.746248122Z", "model": "glm-5.2"}